## Domain flows (product, not navigation)

**Login** (`Login`, `7901:111557`) is a split 1440×1024 — no sidebar. Left: `Logo` White BG · **Log in** (`Headings/H4 - dashboard`) · Email + Password · Remember me (`Checkbox` 24) + `Link` **Forgot password?** · **Log in** Primary Brand Large. Form 400, vertically centered. No create-account. Right: rounded 24 image placeholder. Error twins sit to the right (`7901:111701` wrong password · `7901:111889` unknown email).

**Reset password** follows Buffer’s email-recovery path (not the app OTP). Same split shell. Screens in `Login` (`7901:111556`): empty email `7908:138584` · filled `7908:138602` · recovery sent `7908:138620` · new password + `Requirements` not confirmed `7908:138638` · all confirmed `7908:138656` · success overlay `7914:111598` (dim 70% + 659 `Pop up` on the filled screen: **Password reset successfully**, **Continue** Primary Brand into the panel). CTAs: **Send recovery** (Disable until email) · **Reset password** (Disable until rules pass) · **Back to log in** (email + recovery-sent only). Product: [`admin-users.md`](../../docs/product/flows/admin-users.md).

**Pet profile status.** Created → `Registered`. Support reviews passport +
vaccination record (AI scanning is planned; until then review is manual) →
`Approved`. If microchip number or a mandatory vaccine expires, status returns
to `Registered` automatically and the owner is notified via push + email. No
rejection-reason form — the owner is not told *why* via admin. FigJam:
`Flow — Pet profile status lifecycle`.

**Pet sitter onboarding.** Download app → sign up → verify identity. UAE PASS
sign-up skips identity verification (already verified). Then join Academy →
finish Academy → set up the full profile → ready to receive bookings. FigJam:
`Flow — Pet sitter onboarding`.

**Pet sitter account statuses (5).** Registered → Verified → In academy →
Graduated → Approved. Mapping (product): **In academy** = on the web Academy;
**Graduated** = Academy confirmed, still setting up the operating profile;
**Approved** = setup done, visible to owners. KPI row on `Pet Sitter List - Table View` (`7013:26251`)
is structure 1 plus a Total card (4 cards, `General info` Property 1=4):

| Card | Variant | Big number | Secondary |
|---|---|---|---|
| Total sitters | 1 line | all 5 statuses | trend only (no status split) |
| Pre-academy | 2 | Registered + Verified | Registered · Verified |
| Academy | 2 | In academy + Graduated | In academy · Graduated |
| Approved | 1 line | Approved | trend only |

Icons: `users` / `user-plus` / `book-open` / `user-check`. Icon chips:
Dark blue / Info / warning / Success. Table status filters and columns are
still placeholders until confirmed.

