keeps the same 4 KPI cards, then Graphics-kit panels only (no booking):
sitters through time, by status over time, by emirate, time to approved,
new sitters, by gender, approved share, time in stage, UAE PASS vs manual.
Funnel uses existing `Column` + `.column stats`, not a Mixpanel-style
