**After reassignment** (`Session Detail - #4527 / Session 04 - Reassigned`, `7417:71358`): status becomes **`Reassigned`**, the card retitles to `Reassignment` and gains **reassigned to · reassigned from · reassigned on + by admin** above the original cancellation facts. Header drops to Reassign · Cancel (no Drop — not started, no Mark for refund). This card is the **only** record of the swap, since the app never tells the owner.

`Reassigned` was **added as a real variant** on the local `Booking status` set (`6845:43060`) — Information blue dot, all four Color × Size combos. **The library is not republished**, so nested instances that come through a library `Card` still resolve to the old set; those must be fixed with `swapComponent` to the local variant (e.g. `7430:84480` for Has color / 12) until someone publishes.

